<title>JAPAN: Benchmark cash 182nd JGB sets record low 2.400 pct.</title>
<headline>Benchmark cash 182nd JGB sets record low 2.400 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield of the benchmark cash 182nd Japanese government bond (JGB) fell to 2.400 percent in early Tokyo trade on Thursday, setting a new all-time low for any benchmark cash JGB.</p>
<p>The previous record low of 2.405 percent was set on November 6.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
